1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,450
Rink Field Guide. The Parking Lot Coach.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,100
Habitat: Driver's seat. Engine running. Before and after every game.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,700
Call: "Did you see what I saw on that backcheck?"

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,300
Diet: Gas station coffee. Half a granola bar from the console.

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,900
How To Spot: Only one in the car still talking.

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,500
Behavior: Means every word. Kid's asleep by the second light.

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:20,900
Field note: Is usually me. Working on it.

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:21,000
Follow for more from the rink.

